+; T10g - own code, host-programmed FIFO (harness fifo_bytes/mpeg12_init); poll mode, FIFO fill enabled, record every distinct VLD_STATUS_CTRL value (S0..S7 first 8 changes), host-fed VIFIFO + hardware start-code search + getbits.
+; arg0 (AV_SCRATCH_K) = buf paddr, FIFO = buf[0..0x8000); arg1 (AV_SCRATCH_L) = payload bytes.
+; Buffer holds an MPEG-2 ES starting with a sequence header 00 00 01 B3.
+; S0 = VLD_STATUS_CTRL when the event fired (0xbad0 = timeout)
+; S1 = start code byte (expect 0xb3)  S2 = horizontal_size (0x100)  S3 = vertical_size (0x90)
+; S4 = aspect_ratio (4b)  S5 = frame_rate_code (4b)  S6 = bit_rate[17:2] (16b)  S7 = bit_rate[1:0]
+; S8 = marker bit (1)  S9 = vbv_buffer_size (10b)  SA = VIFF_BIT_CNT after  SB = VIFIFO LEVEL
+; SC = VIFIFO RP  SD = BYTES_AVAIL  SE = poll iterations  SF = 0xdd
